{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A system is a group of staves that are read and played simultaneously. System layout includes left and right"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"margins and the vertical distance from the previous system. The system distance is measured from the bottom"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"line of the previous system to the top line of the current system. It is ignored for the first system on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"page. The top system distance is measured from the page’s top margin to the top line of the first system. It"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"is ignored for all but the first system on a page.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLSystemLayout","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Sometimes the sum of measure widths in a system may not equal the system width specified by the layout","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"elements due to roundoff or other errors. The behavior when reading MusicXML files in these cases is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"application-dependent. For instance, applications may find that the system layout data is more reliable than","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the sum of the measure widths, and adjust the measure widths accordingly.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When used in the defaults element, the system-layout element defines a default appearance for all systems in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the score. If no system-layout element is present in the defaults element, default system layout values are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"chosen by the application."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When used in the print element, the system-layout element affects the appearance of the current system only.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"All other systems use the default values as determined by the defaults element. If any child elements are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"missing from the system-layout element in a print element, the values determined by the defaults element are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"used there as well. This type of system-layout element need only be read from or written to the first visible","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"part in the score.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps the MusicXML ","type":"text"},{"code":"<system-layout>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" element.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemLayout\/init(systemMargins:systemDistance:topSystemDistance:systemDividers:)"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemLayout\/systemDistance","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemLayout\/systemDividers","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemLayout\/systemMargins","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemLayout\/topSystemDistance"]},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemLayout\/Equatable-Implementations"]}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/